      <li><a href="cat-data.html">Data</a> · <a href="cat-dev.html">Developer</a> — CSV cleaning, comparison and pivots, plus JSON, regex, encoding and other developer helpers</li>
      <li>Everyday tools such as <a href="cat-calc.html">calculators</a>, <a href="cat-text.html">text</a> and <a href="cat-convert.html">converters</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Please note</h2>
    <p>Tool results are reference material to help with your work. Before using them for legal, tax or medical decisions or in official reports, always check the relevant laws and the original standards of the responsible institutions. Some tools are designed around Korean laws and standards. For details, see the <a href="terms.html">Terms of Use</a> and <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

